# Example 10 — Derivative-free local refinement (NLOPT:LN_SBPLX).
#
# When the loss is noisy and you do not trust gradient estimates,
# pick a derivative-free local algorithm. SBPLX (Subplex) is a robust
# Nelder-Mead variant; BOBYQA snaps near-bound starts to the interior
# (HPO emits a warning when it would do so silently).

OPTIMIZER
  STRATEGY
    TYPE PLAIN
    LIB NLOPT
    ALGO LN_SBPLX
    MAXEVAL 8
    STEP 0.05
  ENDSTRATEGY
ENDOPTIMIZER

LOSS L2
FAILSCORE 1e16
PC_ERMSE 0 0.0001
PC_LAMMPS --script ../common/lammps/Ecoh.in --varloss Ecoh 8.10 800

OPTIM RCUT2B (1) 4.0 6.0

OUTPUT 1
BOUTPUT 1
